            "id": "pc2_s1_c2",
            "chapterNum": 2,
            "title": "Vision and Mission of C&AG of India",
            "content": "### Institutional Identity: Vision, Mission & Core Values of IA&AD\n\n**Vision**:\n> *'We represent the institutional public accountability mechanism of our country by promoting transparency, accountability and good governance through high quality auditing and accounting, providing independent and timely assurance to the Legislature and other stakeholders.'*\n\n**Mission**:\n> *'Mandated by the Constitution of India, we promote accountability, transparency and good governance through independent, objective, reliable and timely audit and accounting to enhance public confidence and ensure effective use of public resources.'*\n\n**Core Values of C&AG and IA&AD**:\n1. **Independence**: Freedom from political, executive, and administrative influence in planning, executing, and reporting audits.\n2. **Objectivity & Impartiality**: Unbiased, factual, evidence-based reporting without preconceptions or favouritism.\n3. **Integrity**: Absolute honesty, incorruptibility, and ethical adherence.\n4. **Professional Excellence**: Continuous professional competence, rigorous quality control, and adoption of modern audit technologies (data analytics, AI, CAATs).\n5. **Transparency**: Clear, constructive, accessible reporting to Parliament, State Legislatures, and citizens.\n6. **Positive & Constructive Approach**: Recommending actionable, systemic solutions to administrative weaknesses.",
            "gist": "Vision: Promoting transparency, accountability and good governance through high quality audit and accounting. Mission: Independent assurance to Legislature. Core Values: Independence, Objectivity, Integrity, Professional Excellence.",
            "crux": "1. Constitutional foundation under Articles 148-151.\n2. Independence guaranteed by security of tenure and charged expenditure.\n3. Promotes public accountability and citizens' trust.",
