            "content": "### IA&AD Enterprise Cybersecurity Measures\n\n1. **Network & Perimeter Defense**:\n   - Segregated internal network architecture with dedicated firewall perimeters.\n   - Intrusion Detection and Prevention Systems (IDS/IPS) monitoring IA&AD gateways.\n   - Secure VPN connectivity with mandatory Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) for remote access.\n2. **Endpoint & Host Security**:\n   - Centralized Anti-virus and Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR) agents installed on all workstations.\n   - Mandatory disabling of unauthorized USB ports and mass storage devices on official systems.\n   - Automated security patch deployment via centralized update servers.\n3. **Application & Cloud Security**:\n   - Web Application Firewalls (WAF) protecting One IAAD portal, OIOS (One IA&AD One System), and SaiPortal.\n   - Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) strictly enforcing least privilege.\n   - Regular vulnerability assessments and penetration testing (VAPT) by CERT-In empaneled agencies.",
