            "content": "### Cash-Based IPSAS: Global Principles for Public Sector Accounts\n\n1. **Issuing Body**: International Public Sector Accounting Standards Board (IPSASB) under IFAC.\n2. **Core Requirements of Cash-Based IPSAS**:\n   - Preparation of a Statement of Cash Receipts and Payments.\n   - Disclosure of accounting policies and explanatory notes.\n   - Mandatory disclosure of external assistance (foreign loans and grants).\n   - Encouraged additional disclosures: Assets, liabilities, debt commitments, and pensions.",
            "gist": "Cash-based IPSAS establishes global standards for the cash accounting model, mandating cash receipts/payments statements and external assistance disclosures.",
