            "content": "### CAG Guidelines on Joint Review of State Budget (April 2022 Checklist)\n\n1. **Institutional Framework**: Joint review conducted collaboratively by Accountant General (Audit) and Accountant General (A&E) offices.\n2. **Key Checkpoints**:\n   - *Pre-Budget Scrutiny*: AG office sends observations on previous year's persistent savings/excesses, flawed budget heads, and unspent balances to State Finance Department.\n   - *Post-Budget Scrutiny*: Verifying whether budget allocations comply with LMMH 15-digit classification; detecting artificial inflation of revenue estimates.\n   - *Scrutiny of Supplementary Budget*: Ensuring supplementary grants are not sought for schemes where savings are already evident in original grants.\n   - *Review of Budget Speech*: Tracking promises made in Budget Speech vs actual budgetary allocations (identifying unfunded promises).\n   - *Outside Budget Pronouncements*: Monitoring announcements made outside the legislative budget session.",
