            "content": "### Pension Disbursement and Oversight in Treasuries\n\n1. **Custody of Disburser's Halves**: Maintained in secure guarded cabinets arranged alphabetically or by PPO number.\n2. **Annual Life Certificate (Jeevan Pramaan)**:\n   - Verification of pensioner life certificate in November each year.\n   - Aadhaar-based digital biometric authentication (Jeevan Pramaan) or physical appearance before Treasury Officer.\n3. **Dearness Relief (DR) Revisions**: Automated application of government dearness relief orders; preventing under/over-payments.\n4. **Commutation Restoration**: Automatically restoring 40% commuted pension after exactly **15 years** from date of commutation disbursement.\n5. **Family Pension Commencement**: Upon death of pensioner, verifying death certificate and commencing family pension to surviving spouse without delay.",
